.TH SDL_SharedObject 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_SharedObject \- An opaque datatype that represents a loaded shared object.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_loadso.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef struct SDL_SharedObject SDL_SharedObject;
.fi
.SH AVAILABILITY
This datatype is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

